    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the flickering neon lights, a group of girls with diverse backgrounds gather in this rundown, nearly bankrupt nightclub. As the newly appointed, debt-ridden owner, you must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bManage\u200b</strong>\u200b \ud83c\udfad: Allocate resources, upgrade facilities, and tend to your employees to revive the failing business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bStrategize\u200b</strong>\u200b \ud83e\udde0: Analyze customer preferences, assign the best staff, and unleash the ultimate &quot;Andou Time&quot; to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bRomance\u200b</strong>\u200b \ud83d\udc98: Unlock the stories of 6 unique women\u2014from the classic tsundere heiress to a married woman, an innocent maiden to a succubus, and even a <i>femboy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079330/extras/540540bcc1719c0f7a444386d7dbb461.avif?t=1745637633\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By day, prepare for the night; by night, indulge in extravagance. \u200b<strong>\u200bDo you dare to take on this adventure filled with &quot;adult charm&quot;?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">bug :\u00a0<strong><a href=\"mailto:happinessobservationstation@gmail.com\">happinessobservationstation@gmail.com</a></strong></p>",
